      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ارغف</span></b>  <i>He looked sharply,</i> or <i>intently,</i> or
<i>attentively;</i> (JK, O, K;) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِلَيْهِ</span> [<i>at him,</i> or <i>it</i>];
(TK;) said of a man and of a lion. (O.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And
<i>He hastened, made haste,</i> or <i>sped, in going,
